From a81083a25e1da0607569d5cbf6b2d606c029a3c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 23:27:20 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat: root Prettier and ESLint, per-workspace validate, split
 test from coverage

Root Prettier 3 (pinned exactly) and a type-aware root ESLint flat config
with no-floating-promises at error and build output ignored. Every TS
workspace gets format/format:check/lint/typecheck/validate, its test becomes
the fast run and coverage the instrumented one. everything's per-package
Prettier 2 setup folds into the root. typescript is aligned to one range.

Refs #4864

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: cliffhall <cliff@futurescale.com>
